sequenceDiagram
    participant USER as User
    participant CO as ChatOverlay
    participant MB as ModelBrowser
    participant SK as SkillsPanel
    participant CN as ConnectorsPanel
    participant API as /api/chat

    USER->>CO: Type message + press Enter
    CO->>CO: Collect: input text, attached files, active skill context, selected model/tier, sessionId

    alt Skill applied
        USER->>SK: Click "Use" on a skill
        SK->>CO: setInput(skill.prefix + current input)
        Note over CO: skill.mdContent set as skillContext
    end

    CO->>API: POST /api/chat\n{messages, sessionId, skillContext, forceTier, forceModel}
    API->>API: Route to NVIDIA NIM or OpenRouter\nbased on forceTier / forceModel
    API-->>CO: {response, sessionId}

    CO->>CO: Append assistant message
    CO->>CO: emotion → "speaking" for 2s → "listening"

    Note over CO: History tracked by sessionId\nRendered with ReactMarkdown